[[2,3,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the compressor\nengagment circuit.</p><p>The relay receives a supply from the line\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT/A) for the relay\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are housed in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The coil receives a supply controlled by\nthe ignition (15/54) from the line of fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B25</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; the relay\nis thus energized by an earth signal coming from the engine management\ncontrol unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : in this way the air conditioning compressor \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               engagement electromegnet is operated through a voltage\nof 12 V.</p><p>The climate control control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n7 of connector A) sends the signal for enabling the engagement of\nthe compressor to the 4 stage pressure switch K10; if the pressures\nin the circuit are correct, the signal leaves the pressure switch\nand reaches the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 40).</p><p>According to its internal control logic,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the effective command to engage\nthe compressor (from pin 32) which energizes the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]